{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1328835-finding-a-copy-of-adventure","id":1328835,"title":"Finding a copy of Adventure!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Adventure!"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-08-01T17:09:24-07:00","id":1328835,"title":"Finding a copy of Adventure!","content":"Does anyone know where I can actually get a hard copy of Adventure? I've been wanting to play it again but having a heck of a time tracking down a real rulebook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-01T17:45:56-07:00","id":1328844,"title":"","content":"I know they have a PDF on DriveThruRPG, but I don\u2019t know of any hard copies, sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-01T18:06:30-07:00","id":1328846,"title":"","content":"eBay had one from Noble Knight Games the other day. It was $95.<br /> <br /> They\u2019re not common.<br /> <br /> Edit: it\u2019s still there if you think it\u2019s worth it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.ebay.com/itm/White-Wolf-Fantasy-RPG-Adventure-SC-VG/362712523645?epid=15029106055&amp;hash=item547359e37d:g:2j8AAOSwzq5dP~Mz\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.ebay.com/itm/White-Wolf-...8AAOSwzq5dP~Mz</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-03T11:32:20-07:00","id":1329136,"title":"","content":"Hey, y'all? Keep checking those used bookstores.<br /> <br /> Because sometimes, every now and again...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/anTSogZ.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/anTSogZ.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/anTSogZ.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> https://i.imgur.com/anTSogZ.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Just once in a while, some anal retentive nerd will offload a bunch of books that have obviously never, ever been touched.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-04T08:28:11-07:00","id":1329280,"title":"","content":"Doesn't Drivethru publish on demand copies?<br /> <br /> If not, do what I used to do. A) buy the PDF. B) copy your PDF to a thumbnail drive. C) go to your local kinkos or equivalent print shop and get a copy printed and bound. Yes. It is expensive for what you get. But you get a hard copy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-04T09:45:54-07:00","id":1329297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1328835-finding-a-copy-of-adventure?p=1329280#post1329280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doesn't Drivethru publish on demand copies?<br /> <br /> If not, do what I used to do. A) buy the PDF. B) copy your PDF to a thumbnail drive. C) go to your local kinkos or equivalent print shop and get a copy printed and bound. Yes. It is expensive for what you get. But you get a hard copy.</div> </div> </div> </div>The scans of the old Trinity books aren't really high enough quality to do PoD, I'd imagine. OPP isn't offering it with those titles at the moment, anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-04T10:23:26-07:00","id":1329305,"title":"","content":"Alternately you could wait a year or two for the next edition of Adventure! to be kickstarted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-08T16:11:10-07:00","id":1329987,"title":"","content":"I picked one up two or three years ago for about $40 (used of course) from a rando vendor through Amazon. Clearly I got <i>very </i>lucky.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}